WEBVTT

00:12:56.763 --> 00:13:00.930
which is affluent and which can pay
a lot for the drug.

00:13:00.963 --> 00:13:06.663
So it's been about a high-value,
low-volume, kind of a business model.

00:13:07.063 --> 00:13:11.697
Whereas when you live in a country
like India, with over a billion people,

00:13:11.697 --> 00:13:16.530
and you're trying to basically address
the unmet medical needs

00:13:16.563 --> 00:13:18.797
of such a large population,

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.597
it has to be about economies of scale.

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:26.263
It has to be about serving
a large population base.

00:13:26.297 --> 00:13:27.497
So, for instance,

00:13:27.497 --> 00:13:30.963
we are an insulin-producing company.